      "message": "\u0027in/outBufferSize\u0027 is in bytes (it\u0027s a pity these variables lack a unit suffix, as it would be easier to spot the problem), while you have switched these FMQs to floating point samples.\n\nIf there is an intention to use floating point samples for processing, do we allow \u0027input/output.base.format\u0027 to be anything but float?",
